{"id":540,"slug":"the-fire-within","title":"The Fire Within","year":1963,"country":"France","duration":108,"spine":430,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/540-the-fire-within","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/a8c39a413f3134b2940ede42c30c02d3/qL6ZEBtqgDUf0j76xJ6GFEpaGQYXl3_large.jpg","description":"After garnering international acclaim for such seminal crowd-pleasers as The Lovers and Zazie dans le métro, Louis Malle gave his fans a shock with The Fire Within (Le feu follet), a penetrating study of individual and social inertia. Maurice Ronet (Elevator to the Gallows), in an implosive, haunted performance, plays Alain Leroy, a self-destructive writer who resolves to kill himself and spends the next twenty-four hours trying to reconnect with a host of wayward friends. Unsparing in its portrait of Alain’s inner turmoil and shot with remarkable clarity, The Fire Within is one of Malle's darkest and most personal films.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Louis Malle","slug":"louis-malle"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Maurice Ronet","role":"Alain Leroy","slug":"maurice-ronet"},{"actor":"Léna Skerla","role":"Lydia","slug":"lena-skerla"},{"actor":"Jeanne Moreau","role":"Jeanne","slug":"jeanne-moreau"},{"actor":"Yvonne Clech","role":"Ms. Farnoux","slug":"yvonne-clech"},{"actor":"Hubert Deschamps","role":"d’Averseau","slug":"hubert-deschamps"},{"actor":"Jean-Paul Moulinot","role":"Dr. La Barbinais","slug":"jean-paul-moulinot"},{"actor":"Mona Dol","role":"Mrs. La Barbinais","slug":"mona-dol"},{"actor":"Pierre Moncorbier","role":"Moraire","slug":"pierre-moncorbier"},{"actor":"René Dupuis / Dupuy","role":"Charlie","slug":"rene-dupuis-dupuy"},{"actor":"Bernard Tiphaine","role":"Milou","slug":"bernard-tiphaine"},{"actor":"Bernard Noel","role":"Duborg","slug":"bernard-noel"},{"actor":"Ursula Kubler","role":"Fanny","slug":"ursula-kubler"},{"actor":"Alexandra Stewart","role":"Solange","slug":"alexandra-stewart"},{"actor":"Jacques Sereys","role":"Cyrill